1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,725
Speaking, task four. Situation number 19. The examiner describes a situation. Agree with her, choose one option and say why.

2
00:00:11,567 --> 00:00:20,002
We want to work out together on Saturday. Where shall we go? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

3
00:00:28,667 --> 00:00:30,284
We can go to the gym.

4
00:00:30,733 --> 00:00:32,351
The gym is boring.

5
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:34,757
Then let's go to the climbing wall.

6
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,870
Climbing is dangerous.

7
00:00:37,333 --> 00:00:39,003
Then we'll play tennis.

8
00:00:39,467 --> 00:00:41,032
And why there?

9
00:00:41,467 --> 00:00:44,260
Because it's fun and we can play together.

10
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:47,153
You're right. Let's go and play tennis.

11
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:56,688
Practise situation 19 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe to the channel — there's a new video every day.
